WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:01.553
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.503 --> 00:00:03.924
Building a stand is so hard!

3
00:00:03.924 --> 00:00:06.357
Wood, nails, a roof...

4
00:00:06.357 --> 00:00:08.504
Maya is so tired!

5
00:00:08.504 --> 00:00:11.807
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

6
00:00:11.807 --> 00:00:14.085
This is Episode 60.

7
00:00:14.085 --> 00:00:16.041
Meet the magic bean.

8
00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:18.104
Maya gives it her lemon.

9
00:00:18.104 --> 00:00:19.822
She plants it.

10
00:00:19.822 --> 00:00:21.074
Whoosh!

11
00:00:21.074 --> 00:00:23.173
Up grows a whole stand.

12
00:00:23.173 --> 00:00:24.509
Roof.

13
00:00:24.509 --> 00:00:25.904
Counter.

14
00:00:25.904 --> 00:00:27.216
Cups.

15
00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:29.900
And copy stands, ready to pop.

16
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.321
Maya did not hammer one nail.

17
00:00:32.321 --> 00:00:34.420
She just makes lemonade.

18
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:35.958
New flavor?

19
00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:37.974
Give the bean a strawberry.

20
00:00:37.974 --> 00:00:39.226
Whoosh!

21
00:00:39.226 --> 00:00:41.397
The stand is ready again.

22
00:00:41.397 --> 00:00:45.547
And Maya can still open the little door and change anything herself.

23
00:00:45.547 --> 00:00:47.372
You bring the lemon.

24
00:00:47.372 --> 00:00:49.518
The bean builds the rest.

25
00:00:49.518 --> 00:00:51.618
That is the magic bean.

26
00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:54.074
Now you know Elastic Beanstalk!

27
00:00:54.074 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

